# Generated from Go sources by `wails3 generate bindings -ts ./...` (the -ts
# flag matters: without it the codegen emits .js and deletes these .ts files).
# Committed intentionally: the frontend typechecks against them in CI, where
# generating would require a full Go toolchain run first. `just dev` and a
# bare codegen run will wipe them — `just frontend`/`typecheck` restore first
# (see ensure-bindings in the justfile).
!frontend/bindings

# macOS
.DS_Store
